    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i've tried all that before. the hotlines, the therapists... it's all just talking in circles. it doesn't change the fact that my existence is just a problem to be solved. sometimes i think the only real way to stop the noise and the exhaustion is to just... stop. is it even wrong to want that much peace?",
